      "content": "a clean slate? i'm 29. i've wasted my entire prime on this. everyone else in the lab is about to publish, and i'm just... i'm a fraud. if i can't do this, i don't even know who i am anymore. it feels like my whole identity was tied to being \"the researcher.\" without that, there's just nothing. just this huge, empty gap where my life was supposed to be.",
